    "answer": {
      "short": "Refund of \\$1113.17.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Taxable income} &=(84\\,365+4620)-13\\,884\\\\\n\\text{Taxable income} &=\\$75\\,101\\\\\n\\text{Excess} &=75\\,101-45\\,000\\\\\n\\text{Excess} &=\\$30\\,101\\\\\n\\text{Tax payable} &=5092+0.325\\times30\\,101\\\\\n\\text{Tax payable} &=\\$14\\,874.825\\\\\n\\text{Tax payable} &\\approx\\$14\\,874.83\\\\\n\\text{Refund} &=15\\,988-14\\,874.83\\\\\n\\text{Refund} &=\\$1113.17\n\\end{align*}$$\nRicky has paid too much tax and receives a refund of \\$1113.17.",
